OpenBotMotion — pure code-driven SVG mascot animation engine
Version:  1.0.0
Upstream: https://github.com/aa2246740/open-bot-motion
License:  MIT

Used by the floating pill's idle mascot (src/client/idle-robot.tsx) and the nine
idle motions the director schedules (src/client/idle-director.ts).

Vendored as ESM by scripts/vendor-idle.mjs, because the upstream sources are a
UMD bundle (tools/idle/renderer.js) plus a browser <script> (tools/idle/motions.js)
and neither is directly importable:

  tools/idle/renderer.js  ->  src/vendor/open-bot-motion.js
  tools/idle/motions.js   ->  src/vendor/idle-motions.js

A UMD bundle would take its CommonJS branch inside the browser bundle's factory
wrapper and clobber dsh-companion's own exports, so it is converted rather than
depended on.

Full upstream MIT text: tools/idle/LICENSE.open-bot-motion
